{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_toddi_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_toddi_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "装甲与重弩",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_toddi_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "df16cdb8fc38d7de9825223e97399bede19d12bb0ce4b66798ff0b0fde24eb71",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......哈......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......呼......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "左边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "喂，斐迪亚——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我和暴躁铁皮已经在向左移动了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "我的意思是，破城矢的落点在左边——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......你挡我炮位了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "斐迪亚，还活着吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "说真的，我从没打过这么难受的架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "你这个大家伙还蛮结实的嘛。嗯，应该只是被爆炸波及了，看起来没什么大损伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "也许破城矢的装药量可以再提高两成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "那我绝对不会再和你出任务了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯......三号关节的液压系统不太稳定，这笔维修费你帮我出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "不能怪我，你的机甲真的很影响视野，也真的很适合被攻城弩来一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "有机会真得试试，应该打得穿吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......赌上提亚卡乌的名誉，下次你部门内的武器预算申请，我一定投反对票。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "开什么玩笑，你懂不懂攻城武器的重要性？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "师父说了，罗德岛不会装备任何攻城武器。这不符合我们的中立原则。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "不过，你这个大弓箭，也算不得攻城武器就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "什......？！便携攻城弩也是攻城弩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "这弓箭连引擎都没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "弓箭本来就没有引擎！还有我这个是弩炮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我部落里的弓箭就是有引擎的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......想打架吗，斐迪亚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我叫祖玛玛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮",
      "text": "喂，当我们不存在吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉＆森蚺",
      "text": "闭嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮",
      "text": "呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "那就看看你这堆废铜烂铁，到底能不能扛住一发破城矢吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "乐意奉陪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "text": "那个......打扰一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "嫌命长吗？我们这里忙着呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "text": "二位就是罗德岛吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "您是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "text": "啊，顺便提醒你们一下，那架弩炮的右侧扭力系统应该是在刚刚的战斗中磨损了，继续使用的话会对精确度有点影响。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "啧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "text": "那边的......呃......黄色拖拉机？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你可以叫她暴躁铁皮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "text": "最好看看冷却系统的状况，再拖下去引擎会有异响的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......真的！谢谢你，呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "text": "你可以叫我老乔，初次见面，罗德岛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "我是这次任务的委托人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "你们的行动编组......只有两个人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "不信任我们的专业能力吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "怎么会，你们可是慑砂推荐的。罗德岛的名字......在荒地人中也不算陌生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "只是，再怎么说，两个人也......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "哈哈......的确是出了一些意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "再行驶一个小时左右就抵达情报所描述的废弃地块的位置了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "熔泉，森蚺，装备检查得怎么样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "呼，刚刚装完车。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "暴躁铁皮状态良好，之前和师父做了一次全面升级，现在驾驶位坐起来舒服多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啊，这次行动的确没看到那只奇怪的黎博利......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "大祭司爷爷说不能总靠他来驾驶，这毕竟是我的机甲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你来开我反倒更放心一点......熔泉，攻城弩状态正常吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "我说，听博士说有个废弃地块可以打，我才来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "结果，居然是个营救任务？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......现在才反应过来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "哈——我可是为了这次任务，熬了三个大夜，特别赶制了一批超重型破城矢！结果居然是营救在废弃地块里的荒地人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "熔泉......下次行动前好好看看任务简报呗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "因为有敌人已经占领地块并凭借工事反击的可能，我才向博士申请指派你们几个有攻坚能力的干员来的，以防万一嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "就算面对的是废弃地块，可那毕竟曾经是移动城市的一部分，准备好重武器总是没错的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "唉，早知道去逛街了，没劲——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "听说这批荒地人跟着移动城市迁徙了很久了，好不容易等到有地块报废，本来想趁机过几天舒服日子，也能从废弃地块里找些补给。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "结果，这里的帕夏和“约翰老妈”早就签了一份回收合同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "呵，他们做生意的方式一向是比较直接的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我们在前面的坎宁路口集合，从西南方向......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "打断一下，煌大姐，你有没有觉得能见度有点低？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "风声......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "前方天气有异常！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我们这辆车也看到尘云了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "这......这聚集速度！快上车！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "收到本舰发来的联络，前方雷沙暴正在急速形成中！本舰会帮我们导航！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "加速加速加速！我们要离开这里！熔泉你们快跟上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "油门已经踩到底了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不行，你们的速度还是太慢了！抛弃你们的装备！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "没时间了，抛弃装备！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "说实话，我没信心能从可露希尔那再批下一架攻城弩的预算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......暴躁铁皮上周才做的保养。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "能......（滋滋）回答......（滋滋）......抛......本舰（滋滋）......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "导力系统调教起来很麻烦的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "工程部的干员们花了那么多心血才改进的机型。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......舰......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "啧，通讯断了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "左前方的山体有岩洞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "斐迪亚，赌一把？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "没问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "目测车身宽度没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "其他的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "所以是赌一把——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "抓稳了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "所以你们运气不错？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "还好是一场小型的雷沙暴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "出来就遇到了那帮自称沙蜥帮的人，揍起来麻烦得要死。如果我一个人处理可能反而还轻松一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "喂！明明是你乱放箭的错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "我有提示落点，你自己躲得太慢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "二位，我们到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "到得有些晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "听好了，你们非法窃据了约翰老妈旗下资源回收公司的固有财产，根据约翰老妈的用户条款，我们有权利对你们进行合理的驱逐与反击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人A",
      "text": "大人，我们没做任何伤天害理的事情啊！呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人B",
      "text": "救......救命！我的孩子还在里面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "这些混蛋......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "能看得出体表源石结晶，基本都是感染者。注意，敌方也有火炮类武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我会和暴躁铁皮从左侧突入，那里荒地人比较少，不容易误伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "好的。攻城弩已经架设完成了，准备试射——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "第一发射失，根据着弹点调整位置，抬高3.2度，第二发将使用爆破矢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "是总部说的那帮厉害家伙！回击，回击，别让那辆拖拉机接近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "再说一遍！她叫暴躁铁皮——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "不用节约弹药，把你们的炮弹都打出去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "喂，小姑娘！小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "祖玛玛，刹车！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "就这点火力？别小看了我们工程部机甲小组心血的结晶呀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "怎么不动了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "退后，祖玛玛，我来火力掩护！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我在重新发动引擎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "小姑娘，你引擎的第三进气阀烧了，我这有备用零件，掩护我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "最后警告，你们正在妨碍约翰老妈执行合同！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮成员",
      "text": "啧，老大，我们的炮没了，那红发娘们打得真准！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "快嘴，把那门炮给我干掉。我们去解决掉那小蛇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "第四发爆破矢准备！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "休想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "哈！红发娘们，你那大弓箭太危险了，老子接管了！现在站在那里别动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......真麻烦啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "你听好了，不管你们是谁，那帮荒地杂种是怎么联系到你们的。我们清扫掉那帮垃圾是合法合规的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "出示一下合同看看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "......嘿，你看，我们并不是荒野暴徒，我们是资源回收从业者，是资源，就有价值，就值得被利用，比如这里的零件和废铁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "至于不能被归为资源的那部分，很遗憾，我们就进行适当的处理。我对这帮荒地杂种并没有个人好恶，但这就是规矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "“回收利用是文明的本质”，这是我们公司的口号，贴在办公室墙上的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "要是你坦率地告诉我，你信奉谁拳头大谁厉害，我还能高看你一眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "谁让你说话了！现在是我在教育你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "给我听好了，你管一场屠戮叫“文明”？你管切断喉管叫“回收”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "你这娘们！明明是个炮手，为什么——呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "那老头抱着包逃命，你们追逐他取乐，那女人想救她的孩子，你们扯着她的头发拖开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "你们不过是一帮碰巧拿上了刀枪的懦夫，想找些老弱病残逞逞威风罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "别小看我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "好，终于拿出了点骨气，想比比谁的拳头大了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "那我告诉你，我拳头比你大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "熔泉，没事吧！我来帮你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "小心操作！我只是暂时让你的铁疙瘩能动了而已！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "就这些杂鱼？啧，心情不爽，活动活动好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "该死，碰上硬点子了！撤，撤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哇，我好不容易才找到路欸，这就结束了？再陪我玩玩嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "text": "噫——快走，跑啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "都结束了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "嗯，跑了一部分。不过，他们说的帕夏和约翰老妈的协议......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "约翰老妈不会承认的。不过这帮荒地人也得尽快转移，有几个感染者的病情不太乐观啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "熔泉，刚才还挺险的，还好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你干嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "啊，这攻城弩的弦轴稳定器被切掉了，大概是拖拉机入场的时候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "这一拳，你给我老实受着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你之前也打坏了我的液压系统啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "一码归一码！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "不用管吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "呃......熔泉小姐，我手上的材料就只能修到这个程度了，调校可能还需要你自己来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "足够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "森蚺小姐，引擎的状况还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "谢谢你的零件，整修得差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "煌小姐还有些收尾工作需要完成，她说她会直接在本舰与二位会合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "了解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "现在这种气氛，我真的很尴尬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......你们那些荒地人，真的不去附近的罗德岛医疗点吗？他们有的人病得很重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "这就是我们的生活方式，尘归尘，土归土，既然来到了荒野，那归于荒野就是注定的结局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "死在矿石病手里，和死在土匪手里没什么区别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你们就没有向往过......移动城市上的文明吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "......哈，文明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "我们这些荒地人，本身就是被它抛下的人，回不去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "看你的工匠手艺，你究竟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "别问，别打探荒地人以前的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "这个聚落帮过我一次，我按规矩回报他们一次，仅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "翻过前面两个沙丘，就到本舰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "我也该告辞了，谢谢你们搭我一程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "嘿，红发姑娘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "text": "身手不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......是啊，回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "登上罗德岛不会有感觉，但从这个角度看过去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......真是奇迹啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我在萨尔贡的丛林中长大，从未接触过什么机械之类的东西。大家用拳头也能生活得很好。有一天，我偶然看见一座移动城市驶过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "在那个清晨，那个灰蒙蒙的影子，遥远的轰鸣，我一辈子也不会忘，那是文明和进步的声音。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "而我们，现在竟然就在其中一座上生活着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "罗德岛不是移动城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "移动城市里也没有会说话的机器啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "喂，祖玛玛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "你说，我如果在这个距离开一炮，重型破城矢能刺穿罗德岛的外层装甲吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "熔泉，如果你以后还想从师父那里拿经费的话，我建议你不要尝试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "无聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "......我出生在维多利亚，一个萨尔贡的瓦伊凡移民家庭，说起来我们算同乡。我妈妈偶尔还会做几道萨尔贡菜，似是而非吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "短蕉果烤鳞肉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "没那么正宗，只是些红椒茶之类的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "瓦伊凡在维多利亚立足并不容易，要不然去参军，要不然就想办法融入当地，我家办了个工厂，生产一些......滑轮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "没什么技术含量，弄些废铁，回炉重铸，保持好温度，最后浇成圆的，谁都能干。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "直到，我祖父买来了一台机床。不知道他从哪倒腾来的旧型号二手货，巨大，笨重，用了不知道多少年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "你能想象它第一次启动的样子吗？当然惨不忍睹，可是，那巨大的噪声和震颤，那些陈旧的机械结构打开......我听不到自己的心跳了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "比打架爽快，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "一点没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "你刚才说文明与进步......我们从不管机床叫“文明”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "它只是能让我们活得更好一点罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "所以，这就是你们这次的外勤任务？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "不错嘛！听起来还挺刺激的！那个红头发的瓦伊凡，是叫熔泉来着？听起来是个拳头硬的好汉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "感觉你交到了个新朋友啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "哇，谁啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "祖玛玛，我的攻城弩MK30调试好了，来训练场！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "你就是熔泉吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "text": "啊，嘉维尔，我来约森蚺打架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "她刚刚还在和我说她把暴躁铁皮升级成狂躁铁皮了，走走走，今天我休假！你们尽情打，有我呢，别怕受伤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
